1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.154
The Arclight project.

2
00:00:02.154 --> 00:00:05.633
How to exclude eye disease when dispensing eyeglasses?

3
00:00:05.633 --> 00:00:10.850
When dispensing eyeglasses it is important to exclude other underlying eye disease.

4
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.084
With a visual acuity chart and an Arclight device you can quickly find out who needs

5
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:19.318
glasses and what type and who may need referral for other diseases such as cataracts and

6
00:00:19.318 --> 00:00:23.552
glaucoma.

7
00:00:23.552 --> 00:00:30.480
Start with distance visual acuity testing one eye at a time unaided and if reduced use a pinhole.

8
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.520
then test near vision with both eyes together.

9
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:36.920
There are typically five possible outcomes.

10
00:00:36.920 --> 00:00:40.400
If the distance in near visual acuity are both good,

11
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.780
the patient does not need glasses.

12
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:45.160
If the distance vision is reduced,

13
00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.920
but improves with the pinhole and the near vision is okay,

14
00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:53.360
then the patient is most slightly short-sighted, also known as myopic.

15
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:57.920
If the distance vision is reduced but improves with the pinhole,

16
00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:00.920
and the near vision is also reduced,

17
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.920
then the patient is most likely a long sighted,

18
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.920
also known as hyperopia.

19
00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.920
If the distance vision is okay,

20
00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:10.920
but the near vision is reduced,

21
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.920
and the patient is over 40 years of age,

22
00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.920
then they have pressed biopia and need reading glasses.

23
00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:19.920
Finally, if visual acuity is reduced

24
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.920
and does not improve with pinhole or glasses,

25
00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.920
then underlying eye disease is very likely,

26
00:01:25.920 --> 00:01:28.778
patient needs examination with the arc light.

27
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:33.270
Move to a dimly lit room and start with a direct

28
00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.455
pupil light reflex.

29
00:01:34.455 --> 00:01:38.010
Both people should constrict equally and briskly to light.

30
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.590
If they do not

31
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:43.386
constrict well, there is likely to be disease of the optic nerve or retina

32
00:01:43.386 --> 00:01:44.470
at the back of

33
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:49.230
the eye, such as glaucoma or retinal detachment.

34
00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.422
Next check the fundal reflex test.

35
00:01:51.422 --> 00:01:54.710
A bright symmetric reflex means there is nothing blocking

36
00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.730
the light entering the eye.

37
00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.770
If the reflex is reduced or absent, then cataract, corneal

38
00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:05.759
scar, blood in the back of the eye or a tumour, maybe blocking the light.

39
00:02:05.759 --> 00:02:07.090
Next check the front

40
00:02:07.090 --> 00:02:10.396
of the eye, close up with the anterior segment loop.

41
00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.710
Look for any corneal infection and scarring

42
00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:13.578
or cataract.

43
00:02:13.578 --> 00:02:18.782
Finally, perform direct optomoscopy and look into the back of the eye.

44
00:02:18.782 --> 00:02:19.650
Xammon optic

45
00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.850
nerve and retina for signs of glaucoma, thyroid retinopathy, scarring and retinal

46
00:02:24.850 --> 00:02:25.203
detachment.

47
00:02:25.203 --> 00:02:29.790
If any disease is present or you still can't work out why the

48
00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.050
patient's vision is pure, then make a plan for the patient to see an eye specialist.

49
00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:38.090
This video demonstrates that through practice with regular mentorship,

50
00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:42.530
general healthcare workers, even with low-cost tools, can understand if a

51
00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.610
patient would benefit from eyeglasses or need referral for treatment of underlying

52
00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.104
disease.

53
00:02:47.104 --> 00:02:53.530
A powerful process with one low cost tool anywhere in the world by

54
00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:55.930
anyone.
